Jin Yonggang's body

869
00:41:49,880 --> 00:41:50,920
still needs a re-examination.

870
00:41:51,079 --> 00:41:52,280
You think it's my first day as a cop?

871
00:41:53,199 --> 00:41:55,840
There are indeed some details to verify.

872
00:41:56,119 --> 00:41:56,400
So...

873
00:41:56,400 --> 00:41:57,199
Don't try to fool me.

874
00:41:58,000 --> 00:41:59,280
Na Haitao, tell me the truth.

875
00:41:59,760 --> 00:42:01,480
Is it possible or not?

876
00:42:02,039 --> 00:42:03,840
The truth is, Jin Yonggang's body

877
00:42:03,920 --> 00:42:04,840
can't be claimed right now.

878
00:42:10,000 --> 00:42:11,199
I thought the case was closed.

879
00:42:11,280 --> 00:42:13,079
Why the need for a re-examination?

880
00:42:17,800 --> 00:42:18,480
Don't worry.

881
00:42:19,840 --> 00:42:21,000
I'll ask Lao Na tomorrow

882
00:42:21,679 --> 00:42:22,719
about what's going on.

883
00:42:28,519 --> 00:42:28,920
Lao Na,

884
00:42:28,920 --> 00:42:31,119
call me back when you have time.

885
00:42:34,079 --> 00:42:34,679
Hurry up and eat.

886
00:42:35,960 --> 00:42:37,960
I need to be at the SWAT base by 6:30.

887
00:42:38,360 --> 00:42:39,119
Isn't it 7:00?

888
00:42:41,280 --> 00:42:41,840
They

889
00:42:42,519 --> 00:42:44,239
keep doing those mobility drills.

890
00:42:47,840 --> 00:42:50,039
What made you make breakfast today?

891
00:42:50,440 --> 00:42:51,880
If I don't, I'll forget how.

892
00:42:55,280 --> 00:42:56,719
Then forget it. You have me.

893
00:42:58,440 --> 00:42:59,000
Where is my hat?

894
00:43:00,079 --> 00:43:00,639
In the car.

895
00:43:12,280 --> 00:43:13,760
Look at my memory.

896
00:43:13,800 --> 00:43:15,840
I suddenly forgot where I live.

897
00:43:18,239 --> 00:43:19,440
I guess my old problem is acting up.

898
00:43:19,440 --> 00:43:20,239
This is such a big deal.

899
00:43:20,360 --> 00:43:21,639
Why didn't you call me?

900
00:43:22,119 --> 00:43:23,239
Have you seen this person?

901
00:43:23,480 --> 00:43:24,639
Isn't this the woman

902
00:43:24,639 --> 00:43:25,920
held hostage downstairs a few days ago?

903
00:43:26,519 --> 00:43:28,119
Are you promoting yourself

904
00:43:28,760 --> 00:43:30,119
or the SWAT team?

905
00:43:32,440 --> 00:43:34,039
Why don't we give him an out

906
00:43:34,039 --> 00:43:34,960
and just tell him to drop it?
